{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Water Domain|Water]]) 8, [[Cleric]]([[Pestilence Domain|Pestilence]]) 9, [[Cleric]]([[Suffering Domain|Suffering]]) 9, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Shaman]] 8, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Destruction | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = All creatures within the area of effect take 1d8 points of entropy damage per caster level, to a maximum of 25d8.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=316172#p316172 Destruction description] added so works w/ [[Cleric#Path_of_the_Defiler|Defiler]] path. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Water Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Pestilence Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Suffering Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Water Domain|Water]], [[Ooze Domain|Ooze]]) 7, [[Hemomancer]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Acid | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius) | Duration = 1 round / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Acid fog creates a thick, clinging, greenish cloud. Creatures entering the cloud take 4d6 acid damage. Applies a 75% movement speed penalty with no save and -2 to AB and damage rolls for all creatures within the area of effect. Every round a creature spends in the cloud, it suffers 2d6 acid damage.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Ooze Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Water Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Acid Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Acid | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Inflicts 1d6 acid damage for every 3 caster levels to a single target creature.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}} {{:Template:Damage Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|0]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|0]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Acid Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Cleric]]([[Good Domain|Good]], [[Evil Domain|Evil]]) 7, [[Favored Soul]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = When this spell is cast, the caster chooses to be protected from either good or evil. The caster and all nearby allies receives +6 will saves (+3 against neutrals) against creatures of the chosen alignment. The caster receives +4 Deflection AC, 5 + CL SR, and a damage shield of 6 + 1d8 damage against everyone. The holy aura damage shield deals divine damage, while the unholy aura damage shield deals negative energy damage. Damage shield spells (aka biteback) that cause damage to a melee attacker do not stack. The last spell cast overrides any other damage shield. All damage shield spells are moved to the top of the [[Breach List]]. One exception: these spells '''do''' stack with the damage shield of the [[Aura Versus Alignment]] spell. The protections also reduce the [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] probability that summons of the chosen alignments will turn hostile.
| Notes = {{:Template:Biteback Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Good Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Evil Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Divine Damage]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Pestilence Domain|Pestilence]]) 8, [[Cleric]]([[Undeath Domain|Undeath]]) 8, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Shaman]] 9, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Mind-Affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You shoot a black ray of necromantic energy from your outstretched hand, causing your foe to violently purge blood vessels through its skin. The purged blood vessels spread outward, creating a many-layered mass of bloody, adhesive tissue that traps nearby creatures in a gory horror. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack with the ray to strike a target. If the attack is successful, the subject loses half its hit points (capped at 10 HP per Caster Level) and is stunned for 1 round. On a successful Fortitude saving throw, the damage is halved and the subject is not stunned. Nearby enemies around the target must also roll a Fortitude saving throw or be stunned for 1 Round as well. Any sort of mind immunity will automatically be partial for the target. Damage type is Negative.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Pestilence Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Undeath Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]] [[Category:Stun]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Storm Domain|Storm]]) 5, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Shaman]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Electricity | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single, Gargantuan (8.33 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates up to 15 balls, 1 ball per target, that each strike different targets. Each ball doing 1d6/CL lightning damage, max 15d6 damage per ball.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Storm Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Electric Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]] 0, [[Favored Soul]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Blood Arcana | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster drains the subject dealing d3 points of bleeding damage for every 3 caster levels. Healing self for 1 point for every 3 caster levels. Empowered if the target is frightened.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}} {{:Template:Damage Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|0]] [[Category:Bard Spells|0]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|0]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|0]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|0]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Blood Arcana]] [[Category:Healing]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 8, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A giant hand appears and attacks the target, once each round for the duration of the spell. Each hit causes 1d8+11 points of force damage to the target and if they fail their saving throw they are stunned for that round as well.
| Notes = {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 9, [[Hemomancer]] 9, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A giant hand appears and attacks the target. If the target fails its save, the target is held fast for the duration of the spell and suffers 2d6+12 points of force damage each round.
| Notes = {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|9]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Chaos Domain|Chaos]]) 5, [[Cleric]]([[Strength Domain|Strength]]) 4, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A small, spectral hand springs into existence before your target. It hovers in the air, ready to deliver a backhanded blow when the subject attempts to cast a spell. This attack causes no damage, but it forces the subject to make a Concentration check with a DC equal to this spell's save DC. If the subject fails the check, the hand's blow ruins the casting attempt.
| Notes = {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Chaos Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Strength Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Strength Domain|Strength]]) 7, [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Hemomancer]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A target that fails its save is knocked down and is dazed for the duration of the spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Strength Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Strength Domain|Strength]]) 8, [[Elementalist]] 7, [[Hemomancer]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 7, [[Wizard]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A giant hand appears and attacks the target. If the target fails its save, it will be held for the duration of the spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|7]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Strength Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|7]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[Strength Domain|Strength]]) 5, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A giant hand appears over the target, making it difficult for him to attack. He receives a -10 penalty to all attack rolls for the duration of the spell.
| Notes = * Attack penalties (hence also this spell) can be removed with [[Lesser Restoration]]. {{:Template:High Five}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Strength Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Creature holding any weapon | Duration = 1 turn / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Enchants a weapon so that on hit, the target must make a will save. Failing the save inflicts a cumulative 5% vulnerability to magic damage and 10% vulnerability to elemental damage. This malus can be stacked up to 10 times, capping at 50%/100%. The malus duration is 6 rounds, but it is refreshed with every new application. This spell also has a target selection (it is not a personal spell only). Damage vulnerabilities can only increase once per round. Damage vulnerabilities applied by Blackstaff are affected by restoration spells and abilities. Also applies vulnerability against negative energy. Non-restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Not restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=317124#p317124 Affected by restoration] update. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|n]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Negative Energy]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[War Domain|War]]) 5, [[Favored Soul]] 6, [[Hemomancer]] 7, [[Warlock]] 7 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Wall 10 meters long | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Blade barrier brings into being a 30-foot long and 3-foot wide wall of stabbing blades. All those passing through the wall take 1d6 points of slashing damage per caster level. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:War Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Slashing Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Ranger]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Creature holding any weapon | Duration = 2 turns / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = You grant a slashing weapon an enhancement bonus: 2 + 1 / 5 levels beyond the 11th (i.e. +2 at level 11, +3 at level 16, +4 at level 21, +5 at level 26). Additionally, when the enchanted weapon is wielded by a character with [[Ranger]] levels, it grants an equivalent amount of self heal upon every hit. [[Blade Thirst]] may be cast on any kind of melee weapon. If targeted on a creature, the spell will enchant the weapon in the primary hand of the target. Non-restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Not restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|3]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|3]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|n]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Slashing Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Ranger]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Creature holding any weapon | Duration = 2 rounds (+1 with GSF: Trans) | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster ignites the subject's melee weapons, allowing each to deal an additional 2d4 worth of fire damage for the duration. The damage increases to 2d6 at level 9, 2d8 at level 18, and 2d10 at level 27. This spell does not stack with Darkfire or Elemental Weapon. Non-restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Not restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}} {{:Template:Cantrips}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. * Updated to [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=315213#p315213 short] range. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|0]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|0]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|0]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|n]] [[Category:Fire Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Earth Domain|Earth]]) 8, [[Druid]] 8, [[Shaman]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Rocks fall from the sky, causing 1d8 points of bludgeoning damage per caster level (to a maximum of 10d8) to all enemies in the area. Added reflex save against Daze (1 round). Party-friendly.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Earth Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Bludgeoning Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Fire Domain|Fire]]) 1, [[Elementalist]] 1, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = 10 meter cone | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A cone of fire shoots forth from the caster's hands, burning all hostiles and fixtures within its area of effect for 1d6 fire damage per caster level, up to a maximum of 10d6.
| Notes = * Targets only hostiles and fixtures. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|1]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Fire Domain Spells|1]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|1]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|1]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|1]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|2]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|1]] [[Category:Innate Spells|1]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Druid]] 9, [[Elementalist]] 8, [[Shaman]] 9, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = 1 Round / 2 Levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You create a burst of icy energy that flash-freezes any creatures within the spell's area. The spell deals 1d6 points of cold damage per caster level (maximum 25d6 points). Any living creature reduced to 10 hit points or lower is encased in ice and Frozen for 1 round/two caster levels (max 10 rounds).
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|9]] [[Category:Druid Spells|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|9]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]] [[Category:Cold Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Storm Domain|Storm]]) 2, [[Druid]] 3, [[Elementalist]] 3, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Shaman]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Electricity | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = All enemies within the area of effect take 1d6 points of electrical damage per caster level, to a maximum of 10d6. Damage dice are upgraded from d6s to d10s when the spell is cast outside during rain or thunder.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Storm Domain Spells|2]] [[Category:Druid Spells|3]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|3]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Electric Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Storm Domain|Storm]]) 6, [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Favored Soul]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Electricity | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius), 1 target / level | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A bolt of electricity arcs through the caster's enemies for 1d6 points of electrical damage per caster level, up to a max of 20d6 points of damage to the initial target and half that amount to all other targets.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Storm Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Electric Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]]([[Undeath Domain|Undeath]]) 1, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative, Evil | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates a ghostly, skeletal hand in the space of a creature within range. They must make a ranged touch attack against the ceature to assail it with the chill of the grave. On a hit, the target takes 1d2 Entropic and 1d2 Cold damage per 3 caster levels and is sent into a shivering frenzy, receiving a -2 penalty to their Heal and Concentration skills for every 9 caster levels for 1d3 rounds. If the target is undead, it must succeed a Will save or receives a -1 penalty to its Attack bonus per 9 caster levels for 1d3 rounds. The debuff is not applied if caster level is lower than the HD of the target.
| Notes = {{Cantrips}} {{Damage Spells}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. }}
