{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Chaos Domain|Chaos]]) 2, [[Elementalist]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell causes a sphere to move against the target. The caster must make a successful ranged touch attack to hit the target. Once struck the target takes 1d8 points of damage of different element per two caster levels (to a maximum of 5d8 at Level 9).
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
