{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Knowledge Domain|Knowledge]]) 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Divination | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = [[Blindness/Deafness]] | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = For the duration of the spell, the target creature gains a +10 bonus to all listen and spot checks. Spot bonus does not count towards piercing [[Disguise|disguises]]. | Notes = * None | References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Divination School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Knowledge Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 2, [[Cleric]]([[Chaos Domain|Chaos]]) 6, [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Gas | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster blows forth a cloud of noxious air. Enemies in the area of effect are stunned and blinded for 1d6 rounds. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = * Despite the spell saying "Enemies", it effects everyone in the area.
{{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|2]] [[Category:Bard Spells|2]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Chaos Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|2]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|2]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|2]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|2]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|2]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|2]] [[Category:Innate Spells|2]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Stun]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Death | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = 1 round / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A billowing cloud of noxious vapors settles over the area. Its effects vary according to the hit dice of the affected creatures: 1-3 instant death, 4-6 fortitude save or death, 7+ 1d10 poison damage/round. Deals 1d4+1 CON damage per round to all creatures in the area of effect (fortitude save for half). Does not damage corpses. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|5]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Death Effect]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Destruction Domain|Destruction]]) 2, [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell makes a creature burst into flame. The initial eruption of flame causes 2d6 fire damage +1 point per caster level (maximum +10) with no saving throw. Further, the creature must make a reflex save or catch fire taking a further 1d6 points of damage. This will continue until the reflex save is made.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|2]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Destruction Domain Spells|2]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|2]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|2]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|2]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|2]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|2]] [[Category:Innate Spells|2]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 6, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = 11 meter cone | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A cone of frost and snow shoots forth from the caster's hands, doing 1d6 points of cold damage per caster level to all hostiles and fixtures within the area of effect, to a maximum of 15d6.
| Notes = * Targets only hostiles and fixtures. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Pestilence Domain|Pestilence]]) 7, [[Cleric]]([[Plant Domain|Plant]]) 7, [[Cleric]]([[Vermin Domain|Vermin]]) 8, [[Druid]] 7, [[Shaman]] 7, [[Warlock]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster summons a mass of biting and stinging insects which causes 1d6 points of piercing damage. For every subsequent round that a creature remains within the area of effect, the damage inflicted is increased by an increment of 1d6 (i.e. 1d6 for the first round, 2d6 for the second, 3d6 for the third, 4d6 for the fourth, and so on). The spell deals damage until its duration expires or it deals 1,000 points of damage. Also inflicts 1d20 piercing damage to a creature upon entering the insect swarm (which does not count against the damage limit) and applies a 50% movement speed decrease for as long as the creature remains in the area of effect.Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|7]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Pestilence Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Plant Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Vermin Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|7]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|7]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]] [[Category:Piercing Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Favored Soul]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Blood Arcana, Electricity, Curse | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Largeish (20 feet radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex half, Fortitude negates special | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You release a tangle of razor-sharp briars of electrical energy that deals 1d6 points of damage per caster level (maximum 15d6) to the targets within the area. If the main target dies from this spell the briars explode wounding everyone in the area and dealing 1d3 points of damage per caster level (maximum 15d3) and applies a minor curse (-2 Att) (Fortitude negates both the curse and damage). The secondary effect is not affected by metamagic. Half of the damage is Electricity, and half is Bleeding (certain enemies will be immune). Special: This spell belongs to Blood Arcana, as such to cast it a portion of own health needs to be sacrificed as part of the material component.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
