{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Blood Arcana | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex, see text | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Fueled by the caster's own life force, a curse erupts from the chosen area taking shape of a corrupted electric shock. Those caught in the explosion risk further damage as the curse slowly erodes their flesh. Effect: Primary Damage: 1d6 per 3 Caster Levels + 1d6 per GSF & ESF Necromancy Spell Focus feat chain - Type: Electricity. Secondary Damage: 1d6 per 3 Caster Levels - Type: Negative changes to Entropy if the caster has ESF Necromancy feat. Reflex Save halves the damage. Targets with Evasion or Improved Evasion feats who pass the saving throw also dodge the Damage Over Time (DOT) effect. Damage Over Time Effect: Duration: 2 + 1 per 10 Caster Levels. Extend Spell Metamagic adds 2 rounds. Damage ticks every 3 seconds. Stacking: DOT does not stack. Damage: 1d6 + (1d6 if the caster has ESF Necromancy of Primary Damage (Electricity)). 1d10 of Secondary Damage type (see above). Special: This spell belongs to Blood Arcana, as such to cast it a portion of own health needs to be sacrificed as part of the material component.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Blood Arcana]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius), 1d4 tentacles + 1 / caster level (maximum 20) | Duration = 1 Round / 2 Levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A field of thick, 10 foot long fiery tentacles erupt from the ground. Each is capable of grappling a target doing 1 point of fire damage per caster level(maximum 15). If grappled, the target must then make a fortitude saving throw or become paralyzed by the grappling tentacles. The tentacles are randomly spread out over the area of effect allowing no more than half of the tentacles to reach a single target in any given round. Small creatures are not immune to the spell's effects.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Darkness Domain|Darkness]]) 6, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Darkness, Mind Affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will special | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You unleash beams of darkness from your open palm. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack to strike your target(s). You can hurl one bolt for every two caster levels you have (maximum seven bolts). A darkbolt deals 2d6 points of magic damage to a living creature, and the creature is dazed for 1 round unless it makes a Will save. A creature struck by multiple bolts during the same round can only be dazed for 1 round. An undead creature takes no damage but is slowed for 1 round if it fails it's save.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Darkness Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 3, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Warlock]] 2 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single creature or melee weapon | Duration = 2 turns / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Enchant a weapon for AB and damage, based on the hit dice of the creature holding the weapon: 1-6 +1 AB 2 damage, 7-11 +2 AB 4 damage, 12-17 +2 AB 6 damage, 18+ +3 AB 8 damage. The damage type is fire. Restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
