{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 2, [[Cleric]] 2, [[Cleric]]([[Darkness Domain|Darkness]]) 1, [[Favored Soul]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Warlock]] 1, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Darkness | Components = Verbal | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = [[Light]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = All creatures within the area of effect are shrouded in a haze of darkness which can only be pierced using [[Ultravision]]. Removes [[Faerie Fire]] effects for targets entering the Area of Effect. Protects light-sensitive characters when boarding other ships and protects from and restores sunlight penalties to light-sensitive races.
| Notes = * Is no longer considered a hostile spell. NPC companions will no longer attack the caster. Undead spawns (NPC's) ignore Darkness. * Bug: Casting [[Ultravision]] while in [[Darkness]] may cause permanent blindness after resting (or removing ultravision). Relogging fixes the issue. **A bugfix has been applied to solve the issue above, if any other issues exist, please report it in the forums. | References = * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=283929#p283929 Protects and restores sunlight sensitivity] update. * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=316335#p316335 Ship darkness protects boarding] update.
}}
