{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Enchantment | Descriptors = Mind-Affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1d2 Rounds | Counter Spells = [[Clarity]] | Saves = Will Partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell inflicts 1d4 psychic damage for every 3 caster levels to the target. If the target is a humanoid creature with less Hit Dice than the caster level and fails their will saving throw, they are also dazed for 1d2 rounds.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
