{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]] 3, [[Druid]] 4, [[Elementalist]] 3, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Paladin]] 3, [[Shaman]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius), or Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell attempts to strip all magical effects from a single target. It can also target a group of creatures, attempting to remove the two most powerful spell effect from each creature. To remove an effect, the caster makes a [[Dispel Tables|dispel]] check up to +10 dispel caster level.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|3]] [[Category:Druid Spells|4]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|3]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|3]] [[Category:Paladin Spells|3]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|4]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Magical Damage]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Druid]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Pale Master]] 15, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 22 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Conjuration | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Point | Duration = 2 round / level | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster summons a powerful dragon to the targeted location. The type of dragon is dependent upon the summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details. Epic spells are not affected by arcane spell failure from armor, nor can they be interrupted, countered, or dispelled. When cast with the Dracolich stream, the spell now counts as a Necromancy spell, thereby bypassing some specialist wizards' spell school limitations.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Epic Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|e]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|e]] [[Category:Druid Spells|e]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|e]] [[Category:Pale Master Spells|e]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|e]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|e]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|e]] [[Category:Innate Spells|e]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Water Domain|Water]]) 6, [[Druid]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Warlock]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Transmutation | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates water in the lungs of a target creature. Any drowned creature takes 90% of its current hit points as bludgeoning damage (Fortitude save) and also takes 2d10+5 bludgeoning damage (no save). Golems and other nonliving creatures cannot be drowned.
| Notes = * Immunities still apply to both damage allocations. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Water Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Druid Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Bludgeoning Damage]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Cleric]]([[Earth Domain|Earth]]) 7, [[Druid]] 9, [[Elementalist]] 8, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Shaman]] 9 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster causes a massive earthquake around himself, causing 1d6 points of damage per caster level (to a maximum of 30d6) to all creatures in the area of effect. The caster is not affected by the earthquake. Characters that fail the reflex save will be knocked down for 3 seconds.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Earth Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Druid Spells|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Electricity | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Inflicts 1d6 electrical damage for every 3 caster levels to a single target creature.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|0]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|0]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Electric Damage]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Druid]] 21, [[Elementalist]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 32 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Conjuration | Components = Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous (Summon: 24 hours<ref>If elementalist levels are present, the summon will instead last 2 rounds / level.</ref>) | Saves = Reflex (Half), Neglects Evasion | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster calls down an elementally charged meteor that does 20d6 damage to all targets in its blast radius. Damage is dependent on the current elemental stream, if no stream is selected then one of the four basic elements will be chosen. After impact a Monolothic Elemental of the same type as the meteor will spawn as a minion of the caster, serving for 24 hours. Meteor damage per stream; Air: 10d6 Lightning and 10d6 Sonic; Fire: 20d6 Fire; Water: 10d6 Cold and 10d6 Blunt; Earth: 15d6 Blunt and 5d6 Force; Ooze: 20d6 Acid. Elemental Stream affects the monolith conjured. Elementlists are locked with their element of choice. <references /> | Notes =
{{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Epic Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|e]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|e]] [[Category:Druid Spells|e]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|e]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|e]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|e]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|e]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|e]] [[Category:Innate Spells|e]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Favored Soul]] 2, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Creature or melee weapon | Duration = 2 turn / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Sets a melee weapon aflame for AB and damage, based on the hit dice of the creature holding the weapon: 1-6 +1 AB 2 damage, 7-11 +2 AB 4 damage, 12-17 +2 AB 6 damage, 18+ +3 AB 8 damage. Fire damage by default, but can be changed with [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] selections. Restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|2]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|2]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|2]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|2]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|2]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|2]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|2]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|r]] [[Category:Innate Spells|2]] [[Category:Fire Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Plant Domain|Plant]]) 1, [[Druid]] 1, [[Ranger]] 1, [[Shaman]] 1, [[Warlock]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = 3 + 1 round / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex, special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A mass of clinging vegetation wraps around all creatures in the area of effect. Those who fail the same are immobilized, flatfooted, receive a -2 penalty on all attack rolls and sets their dexterity to 3; though still able to fight and cast spells, but must make a concentration check (DC 15) or the attempt will fail. All those affected, even those who make a reflex save, have their movement reduced by half. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = * Creatures with [[Woodland Stride]] are immune to this spell {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|1]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Plant Domain Spells|1]] [[Category:Druid Spells|1]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|1]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|1]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|1]] [[Category:Innate Spells|1]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Ooze Domain|Ooze]]) 5, [[Hemomancer]] 6, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius), 1d4 tentacles + 1 / caster level (maximum 20) | Duration = 1 round / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A field of thick, 10 foot long rubbery tentacles rises from the ground. Each is capable of grappling a target doing 1d6+4 points bludgeoning damage. If successful, the target must then make a fortitude saving throw or become paralyzed by the grappling tentacle. The tentacles are randomly spread out over the area of effect allowing no more than half of the tentacles to reach a single target in any given round. Small creatures are not immune to the spell's effects.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Ooze Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|4]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Death Domain|Death]], [[Suffering Domain|Suffering]]) 4, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Shaman]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 3 Rounds | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = As you crook your finger, your enemy feels their vitals rupture within them. You magically disrupt the subject's internal organs, causing it great pain. The target becomes Sickened for 3 rounds. The first round the target takes 3d6 and each subsequent round the damage increases by 1d6 ending at 5d6 on round 3. A successful Fortitude save halves the damage and avoids Sickened for that round.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
