{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Druid]] 7, [[Elementalist]] 7, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Shaman]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire, Divine | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = All enemies within this spell's area of effect are inundated with a rain of fire and take 1d6 points of damage per caster level. Half of the damage is divine and the other half is fire-based.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
