{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Fire Domain|Fire]]) 3, [[Druid]] 2, [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Warlock]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The druid is able to flay an enemy with flaming brands that do 2d6 points of fire damage, + 1d6 per 2 caster levels above level 4.
