{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 8, [[Druid]] 6, [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Hemomancer]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 Round / Level | Counter Spells = [[Scorching Ray]] | Saves = Reflex partial, Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A violent blue ray swirled with white streaks emerges from your outstretched hand striking your target. You must make a successful ranged touch attack to hit. A target struck takes 10d6 points of cold damage, fortitude save for half, and must succeed on a Reflex save or be Frozen for 1 round per caster level.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|4]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Warlock]] 2, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative, Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A sphere of darkness shoots out towards the target. The caster makes a ranged touch attack. On a hit, the subject takes 2d10 + 2 damage per 2 caster levels, half of which is Cold and half of which is Entropic, has its movement speed reduced by 10% for 1d2 rounds, and on a failed fortitude save is Blinded for 3 rounds.
| Notes = {{Damage Spells}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=315363#p315363 Damage and move] updated. }}
