{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]], [[Water Domain|Water]]) 5, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Favored Soul]] 4, [[Shaman]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold, Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster is surrounded by a ring of frost that damages all opponents who make a successful melee attack on the caster. The damage inflicted is 1d6 cold, +1 point per caster level. The caster also gains 50% immunity to cold and fire. Damage shield spells (aka biteback) that cause damage to a melee attacker do not stack. The last spell cast overrides any other damage shield. All damage shield spells are moved to the top of the [[Breach List]]. One exception: these spells '''do''' stack with the damage shield of the [[Aura Versus Alignment]] spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:Biteback Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Water Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|4]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|4]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|4]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Fire Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Druid]] 3, [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Favored Soul]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 2, [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Combust]] | Saves = Fortitude partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell makes a creature experience extreme cold. The initial touch of cold causes 2d4 cold damage +1 point per caster level (maximum +8) with no saving throw. Further, in each round the creature must make a fortitude save or freeze taking a further 1d4 points of damage and slowed for 10% less movement speed. This will continue until the fortitude save is made.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|2]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|2]] [[Category:Druid Spells|3]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|2]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|2]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|2]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|2]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|2]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|2]] [[Category:Innate Spells|2]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 9, [[Cleric]]([[Evil Domain|Evil]], [[Good Domain|Good]]) 8, [[Favored Soul]] 9, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Point | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This powerful summoning spell opens a portal to another plane. The type of summon is dependent upon the specific summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|9]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|9]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Evil Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Good Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Earth Domain|Earth]]) 2, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = Sonic | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meters radius) | Duration = 1 turn / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates a small, magical zone that can detect the passage of enemy creatures. When the field is activated, it explodes, doing 1d6 points of sonic damage per two caster levels to all creatures within the area of effect (to a maximum of 10d6). After being triggered, the glyph dissipates.
| Notes = * This spell has been fixed to use the correct DC instead of a fixed DC 14. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Earth Domain Spells|2]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Magical Damage]] [[Category:Sonic Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 1, [[Cleric]]([[Water Domain|Water]], [[Ooze Domain|Ooze]]) 1, [[Druid]] 2, [[Elementalist]] 1, [[Harbinger]] 1, [[Hemomancer]] 1, [[Ranger]] 1, [[Shaman]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Warlock]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Medium (3.33 meters radius) | Duration = 2 rounds + 1 / 3 levels | Counter Spells = [[Freedom of Movement]] | Saves = Reflex | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A churning field of oil and grease fills the target area, causing all within to either fall down or move at a reduced speed. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = *The speed reduction is 50%, and this is applied upon entering the area of effect. (So, for example, having freedom when entering the area of effect negates the speed reduction, even if freedom is lost while in the affected area.) There is no saving throw for this aspect of the spell. *The chance of falling down occurs every six seconds, independent of whether or not the speed reduction was effective. Staying on one's feet requires passing the saving throw (or immunity to knockdown). *Creatures with woodland stride are immune to this spell, but due to a bug, incorporeal creatures are not. *The speed reduction stacks when multiple grease spells have overlapping areas (overlapping is limited, see below). {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|1]] [[Category:Bard Spells|1]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Water Domain Spells|1]] [[Category:Ooze Domain Spells|1]] [[Category:Druid Spells|1]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|1]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|1]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|1]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|1]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|1]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|1]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|1]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|1]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|1]] [[Category:Innate Spells|1]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 5, [[Cleric]] 6, [[Elementalist]] 7, [[Favored Soul]] 6, [[Hemomancer]] 7, [[Druid]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius) or Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Greater dispelling attempts to strip all magical effects from a single target. It can also target a group of creatures, attempting to remove the two most powerful spell effect from each creature. To remove an effect, the caster makes a [[Dispel Tables|dispel]] check up to +23 dispel caster level.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|5]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|7]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|7]] [[Category:Druid Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Magical Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]] 4, [[Favored Soul]] 4, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Paladin]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Creature or melee weapon | Duration = 1 hour / 3 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = You empower the touched weapon with a +1 enhancement bonus per caster levels +3 divided by 4 (maximum of +5). You can either directly target the weapon you want to cast this spell on, or you can target a creature, affecting the creature's main hand weapon. Restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|4]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|4]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|3]] [[Category:Paladin Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|r]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Cleric]] 8, [[Cleric]]([[Law Domain|Law]]) 8, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single or Point | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will (+5 DC) negates | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell has two modes of operation: targeting a single outsider, or summoning a planar ally. Targeted outsiders are paralyzed for 1 round per 2 caster levels. The type of summoned ally is based on the the specific summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|8]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Law Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Druid]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Elementalist]] 21, [[Hemomancer]] 21, [[Pale Master]] 15, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 25 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Evocation | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = 45d6 + 10 entropy damage to a single target. Casters without [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Evocation|Epic Spell Focus: Evocation]] will take 30d6 as backlash damage when casting. Epic spells are not affected by arcane spell failure from armor, nor can they be interrupted, countered, or dispelled.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Epic Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|e]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|e]] [[Category:Druid Spells|e]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|e]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|e]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|e]] [[Category:Pale Master Spells|e]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|e]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|e]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|e]] [[Category:Innate Spells|e]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Illusion | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Special | Area of Effect = Special | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = Special | Saves = Special | Spell Resistance = Special
| Description = Allows the caster to conjure a shadow variant of one of the following spells: [[Web|Web(?)]], [[Minor Globe of Invulnerability|Minor Globe of Invulnerability(11)]], [[Stoneskin|Stoneskin(10+)]], [[Summon Shadow|Summon Shadow(11)]], [[Flame Arrow|Flame Arrow(?)]]. All spells are be considered Illusion and use Illusion focus for calculating the DC. Summon Shadow summons 3 shadows and the summons duration is 1 round / caster level. Duration becomes turns per level with [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Illusion|Spell Focus: Illusion]], hours per level with [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Illusion|Greater Spell Focus: Illusion]], and hours * 2 per level with [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Illusion|Epic spell Focus: Illusion]]. The shadows also gain 10% more concealment per Illusion Focus feat.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Illusion School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[Darkness Domain|Darkness]]) 7, [[Sorcerer]] 7, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Illusion | Descriptors = Mind-Affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Special | Area of Effect = Special | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Special | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster taps energy from the Plane of Shadow to cast a quasi-real, illusory version of a the following: Shadow Storm, Bigby's Interposing Hand, Ball lighting, or Ice Storm. Shadow Storm: From a sudden rift into the Plane of Shadow, torrents of shadow arc out, striking nearby creatures for electricity and cold damage. Much like some of the most fearsome weather found on the Plane of Shadow the storm strikes one target initially, then arcs to other targets.The initial strike deals 1d8 points of damage per caster level (maximum 20d8). Half of this damage is electricity damage, and the other half is cold damage. After it strikes, the storm arcs (like the spell chain lightning) to a number of secondary targets equal to your caster level (maximum twenty). The secondary arcs each strike one target and deal half as much damage as the primary one did. All spells are be considered Illusion and use Illusion focus for calculating the DC.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Illusion School|7]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Darkness Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|7]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Shaman]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = [[Globe of Invulnerability]], [[Greater Spell Mantle]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell strips the target creature of up to four magical defenses according to the [[Breach List]]. This spell will also reduce the target creature's SR by 5 for ten rounds.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Magical Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 9, [[Hemomancer]] 9, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 turn / level | Counter Spells = [[Greater Spell Breach]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Creates a barrier around the caster that absorbs all incoming spells. It can absorb up to 4d6 + 1/6 CL levels of spells before collapsing.
| Notes = * Spell mantles cast via items have a diminished duration of 1 Round per Level. {{:Template:SpellMantles}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|9]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 7, [[Favored Soul]] 7, [[Hemomancer]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 7, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Blood Arcana | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster outcries forth a nightmare curse. The caster causes 4d6 + 1d6 / per 4 caster levels (max 15d6) points of psychic damage and frightens everyone within the area. Will save: half the damage received and neglects the fear effect. (Creatures with mind effect immunity take no damage). The DC is increased by 2 if the caster is below 50% HP. Base Size: Huge (6.67 meters radius). Size increases by 1 category if the caster has Epic Spell Focus (Necromancy). Furthermore size increases by 1 category if the caster is Wizard Necromancy Specialist, Pale Master, Hemomancer, Warlock(Undying II), Cleric with Death or Undeath domain.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|7]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|7]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|7]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|7]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]] [[Category:Blood Arcana]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Fear Effect]] [[Category:Death Effect]] [[Category:Curse]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 4, [[Cleric]]([[Forge Domain|Forge]]) 3, [[Favored Soul]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Divine | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster smites a group of enemies with divine light for 1d8 points of damage for every two caster levels, to a maximum of 10d8. Enemies that make a will save take half damage and avoid being dazed for 1 to 6 rounds.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|4]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Forge Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Divine Damage]] [[Category:Will Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[Suffering Domain|Suffering]]) 5, [[Druid]] 7, [[Favored Soul]] 6, [[Shaman]] 7 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Heal]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Deals 10 * CL points of damage. Will not reduce health below 1 HP. Damage can not longer exceed a target's current health, regardless of existing Damage Vulnerabilities. The effect of Damage Immunities is unchanged.
| Notes = {{:Template:Inflict Wounds}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Suffering Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Druid Spells|7]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Negative Energy]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Druid]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Elementalist]] 21, [[Hemomancer]] 21, [[Pale Master]] 15, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 32 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Evocation | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Super-colossal (20 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous* | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Does 10d6 Divine, Entropy, Negative and Positive damage each. Has no saving throw. Will not damage the environment (placeables, etc). Casters without [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Evocation|Epic Skill Focus: Evocation]] will take 30d6 as backlash damage when casting. Normally, casting this spell produces a projectile that circles the target for a few seconds before the spell goes off. Targeting this spell on the caster will skip the projectile, causing the spell to go off immediately. Those caught in the blast are knocked prone for 3 seconds. Epic spells are not affected by arcane spell failure from armor, nor can they be interrupted, countered, or dispelled.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Epic Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|e]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|e]] [[Category:Druid Spells|e]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|e]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|e]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|e]] [[Category:Pale Master Spells|e]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|e]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|e]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|e]] [[Category:Innate Spells|e]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Pestilence Domain|Pestilence]]) 5, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Ranger]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Blood Arcana | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 10 rounds | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fort, special | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The target must have blood. The caster weaves a vulnerability curse at the target. The curse causes a burst of bleeding damage and decreases resistance to damage. The caster causes 3d6 + 1d6 / per 3 caster levels (max 10d6) points of damage. This is further (damage dice and DC) increased: by 1 if the target is: lightly wounded (80%-50% HP); by 2 if the target is heavily wounded (50%-25% HP); by 3 if the target is near death (below 25% HP). Half of the damage is negative, half is bleeding type. Fortitude saves halves the damage received and neglects the curse. (The curse is tagged, multiple applications and sources do not stack). Curse of Hemorrhage: vulnerability to slashing, piercing, and bleeding 10%. Increases by 5% if the caster has Epic Spell Focus (Necromancy). Increases by 5% if the caster is Wizard Necromancy Specialist, Pale Master, Hemomancer, Warlock(Undying II), Cleric with Death or Undeath domain.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Pestilence Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|3]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Blood Arcana]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Piercing Damage]] [[Category:Slashing Damage]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Death Effect]] [[Category:Curse]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Paladin]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell transforms the caster's melee weapon into a powerful holy avenger, a specially blessed weapon that, when wielded by paladin, acts like a +5 holy weapon that dispels magic on-hit and grants the wielder a spell resistance of 16. Self target only. The On-Hit Dispel effect is capped at caster level 21. If the caster has Abjuration Foci, the Dispel check improves by +1 per focus feat. Holy sword can only trigger once per flurry (ie. 2 second cooldown) and has a 1 round cooldown after successfully removing 1+ effects from a target. Can no longer be crafted into wands or scrolls. Non-restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Not Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|4]] [[Category:Paladin Spells|4]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|n]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Sonic, Mind-affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You blast the target with loud and high-pitched sounds. The target takes 1d4 points of sonic damage per two caster levels (maximum 15d4) and must make a will save or be deafened for 1d4 rounds
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
