{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 1, [[Elementalist]] 1, [[Harbinger]] 1, [[Hemomancer]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You create a piece of ice that flies toward the target and deals 1d4 points of cold damage per level (maximum of 20d4).
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|1]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|1]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|1]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|1]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|1]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|1]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|1]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|1]] [[Category:Innate Spells|1]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 7, [[Druid]] 5, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Shaman]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = All creatures in the area of effect take 3d6 points of bludgeoning damage and 2d6 points of cold damage. Ice storm will do an additional 1d6 cold damage per additional 3 caster levels.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|4]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Druid Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|4]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Bludgeoning Damage]] [[Category:Cold Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Cold Domain|Cold]]) 9, [[Druid]] 9, [[Elementalist]] 9, [[Hemomancer]] 9, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Cold | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = 1 Round / Level | Counter Spells = Meteor Swarm | Saves = Reflex 1/2 damage and ignore the immobilization effect | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = Iceberg is a brutal and direct spell dealing 1d6 blunt and cold damage per two caster levels to targets closest to the center. Affected targets will be encased in ice if they fail a saving throw, effectively immobilizing them for 1d3 rounds. Creatures larger than Medium are unaffected by the immobilizing effect. Targets inside the center of the spell (within 5m) have an increased save DC +3 for damage and immobilizing effects
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|9]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Cold Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Druid Spells|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|9]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]] [[Category:Cold Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8, [[Cleric]]([[Fire Domain|Fire]]) 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex for half | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates a cloud of smoke and embers that causes 4d6 + 1d6 per 2 levels points of fire damage each round to all creatures within the area of effect. Creatures within the area of effect are blinded (no save). Does not damage corpses. Persistent area spells do not stack with themselves. When the same spell is cast it will be replaced and refreshed. Different area spells may be stacked. Same spell by different caster stacks. The same spell may be cast away from 50% of the center of the Area of Effect (AoE) radius, allowing a section where they can overlap, and hit twice.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Fire Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Fire Domain|Fire]]) 7, [[Cleric]]([[Forge Domain|Forge]]) 8, [[Druid]] 5, [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Shaman]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster causes a target to ignite into flame. Each round the target will suffer 2d6 points of fire damage. Damage increases to 3d6 with [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Transmutation|Greater Spell Focus: Transmutation]] and 4d6 with [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Transmutation|Epic Spell Focus: Transmutation]].
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Fire Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Forge Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Fire Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 4, [[Cleric]] 4, [[Cleric]]([[Death Domain|Death]]) 3, [[Favored Soul]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Cure Critical Wounds]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = If the caster succeeds in striking an opponent with a touch attack, the target suffers 8d8 points of damage + 1 / character level of the target; no maximum. Inflict spells have a reverse effect when used on undead, causing the targeted undead to take an amount of healing equal to what the spell normally damages.
| Notes = {{:Template:Inflict Wounds}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|4]] [[Category:Bard Spells|4]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Death Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Healing]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 1, [[Cleric]] 1, [[Favored Soul]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = [[Cure Light Wounds]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = If the caster succeeds in striking an opponent with a touch attack, the target suffers 2d8 points of damage, + 1 point per caster level. Inflict spells have a reverse effect when used on undead, causing the targeted undead to take an amount of healing equal to what the spell normally damages.
| Notes = {{:Template:Inflict Wounds}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|1]] [[Category:Bard Spells|1]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|1]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|1]] [[Category:Innate Spells|1]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Healing]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]] 0, [[Favored Soul]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = [[Cure Minor Wounds]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = If the caster succeeds in striking an opponent with a touch attack, the target suffers 1d6 points of damage for every 3 caster levels. Inflict spells have a reverse effect when used on undead, causing the targeted undead to be healed by a lower 1d3 damage per 3 caster levels.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}} {{:Template:Inflict Wounds}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
