{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]] 3, [[Favored Soul]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Cure Serious Wounds]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = If the caster succeeds in striking an opponent with a touch attack, the target suffers 6d8 points of damage + 1 / character level of the target; no maximum. Inflict spells have a reverse effect when used on undead, causing the targeted undead to take an amount of healing equal to what the spell normally damages.
| Notes = {{:Template:Inflict Wounds}} {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
