[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Healing]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 7, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Gargantuan (8.33 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A number of energy missiles (one per caster level but to a maximum of 20) appear and randomly target and hit any hostile creature in the area of effect. If there are more creatures than missiles, only the closest targets will be damaged. If there are more missiles than creatures, one of the creatures will be hit with multiple missiles. Each missile does 2d6 points of force damage. Cannot strike one target with more than ten missiles. This limits it to only producing ten missiles if only one viable target is present upon casting.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Magic Domain|Magic]]) 5, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Gargantuan (8.33 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A number of energy missiles (one per caster level but to a maximum of 10) appear and randomly target and hit any hostile creature in the area of effect. If there are more creatures than missiles, only the closest targets will be damaged. If there are more missiles than creatures, one of the creatures will be hit with multiple missiles. Each missile does 1d6 points of force damage.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Magic Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Luck Domain|Luck]]) 3, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = Weapon Enchantment | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Creature or melee weapon | Duration = 2 minutes / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Adds the keen property to the targeted edged melee weapon. Based on the hit dice of the creature holding the weapon and caster level for duration: 1-6 +1 AB Keen 1d4 massive criticals, 7-11 +2 AB Keen 1d8 massive criticals, 12-17 +3 AB Keen 2d6 massive criticals, 18+ +4 AB Keen 2d8 massive criticals. Restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Luck Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Weapon Enchantment|r]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Undeath Domain|Undeath]]) 6, [[Hemomancer]] 7, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius), 1d4 tentacles + 1 / caster level (maximum 20) | Duration = 1 Round / 2 Levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = A field of thick, 10 foot life draining tentacles erupt from the ground. Each is capable of grappling a target. If grappled, the target takes 1d4+1 negative damage per tentacle (or with ESF Necromancy: Entropy Damage) and must then make fortitude saving throws against level drain(1d3) and paralysis. The tentacles are randomly spread out over the area of effect allowing no more than half of the tentacles to reach a single target in any given round. Small creatures are not immune to the spell's effects.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Undeath Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|7]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 1, [[Cleric]] 2, [[Druid]] 2, [[Elementalist]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 2, [[Favored Soul]] 2, [[Shaman]] 2, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Warlock]] 2, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius), or Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell attempts to strip all magical effects from a single target. It can also target a group of creatures, attempting to remove the two most powerful spell effect from each creature. To remove an effect, the caster makes a [[Dispel Tables|dispel]] check up to +5 dispel caster level.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|2]] [[Category:Bard Spells|1]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|2]] [[Category:Druid Spells|2]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|2]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|2]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|2]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|2]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|2]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|2]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|2]] [[Category:Innate Spells|2]] [[Category:Magical Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 4, [[Cleric]] 5, [[Cleric]]([[Evil Domain|Evil]], [[Good Domain|Good]], [[Law Domain|Law]]) 4, [[Favored Soul]] 5, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single or Point | Duration = 1 hour / 2 levels | Counter Spells = [[Dismissal]] | Saves = Will negates | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell has two modes of operation: targeting a single outsider, or summoning a planar ally. Targeted outsiders are paralyzed for 1 round per 2 caster levels. The type of summoned ally is based on the the specific summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|4]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Evil Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Good Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Law Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|5]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Magic Domain|Magic]]) 4, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Shaman]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = [[Minor Globe of Invulnerability]], [[Lesser Spell Mantle]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell strips the target creature of up to two magical defenses according to the [[Breach List]]. This spell will also reduce the target creature's SR by 3 for ten rounds.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|4]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Magic Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Magical Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Magic Domain|Magic]]) 7, [[Cleric]]([[Protection Domain|Protection]]) 8, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 turn / level | Counter Spells = [[Lesser Spell Breach]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Creates a barrier around the caster that absorbs all incoming spells and spell-like abilities. It can absorb up to 1d6 + 1/6 CL (avg: 9.5, empowered: 11) levels of spells before collapsing.
| Notes = * Spell mantles cast via items have a diminished duration of 1 Round per Level. {{:Template:SpellMantles}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Magic Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Protection Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]] 0, [[Druid]] 0, [[Elementalist]] 0, [[Favored Soul]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Paladin]] 0, [[Ranger]] 0, [[Shaman]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = [[Darkness]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Creates a small light source above the target creature's head. The light travels with the target and is capable of illuminating a small area. It can be cast on any item the character can equip to make it glow for the spell's duration like a natural source of light. The color of the spell can be changed using the text command prior to casting: Green: -gre, White: -wht, Yellow: -yel, Orange: -ora, Red: -cri, Purple: -pur, Blue: -blu.
| Notes = * Can be cast on fixtures. {{:Template:Cantrips}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|0]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|0]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|0]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|0]] [[Category:Ranger Spells|0]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Bard Spells|0]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|0]] [[Category:Druid Spells|0]] [[Category:Paladin Spells|0]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Storm Domain|Storm]]) 3, [[Druid]] 3, [[Elementalist]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Shaman]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Warlock]] 2, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Electricity | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Straight line | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster fires a bolt of lightning that passes through all creatures in a straight line from the caster. The bolt does 1d6 points of electrical damage per caster level, to a maximum of 15d6.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Druid Spells|3]] [[Category:Storm Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|3]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|3]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|2]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Electric Damage]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Air Domain|Air]]) 8, [[Cleric]]([[Storm Domain|Storm]]) 7, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Favored Soul]] 5, [[Shaman]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Lightning | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell creates a lightning shield around your person. Any creature striking you with its body does normal damage, but at the same time the attacker takes 1d6 points +3 points per 2 caster levels of electrical damage. The caster also gains 25% immunity to electrical damage. Damage shield spells (aka biteback) that cause damage to a melee attacker do not stack. The last spell cast overrides any other damage shield. All damage shield spells are moved to the top of the [[Breach List]]. One exception: these spells '''do''' stack with the damage shield of the [[Aura Versus Alignment]] spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:Biteback Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Air Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Storm Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|5]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Evil Domain|Evil]], [[Good Domain|Good]]) 2, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Paladin]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Medium (3.33 meters radius), around a single creature | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = When this spell is cast, the caster chooses to be protected from either good, evil, law, or chaos. The spell target and all party members within 3.3 meter radius receive protection against creatures of the chosen alignment: +2 deflection bonus to armor class, +2 to all saving throws, and +4 will saves. Bonuses granted by multiple alignment spells are cumulative, but characters can only be warded against two alignments at a time. Bonus saves against neutral creatures are reduced by half and deflection AC only applies to chosen protections. The protections also reduce the [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] probability that summons of the chosen alignments will turn hostile.
| Notes = {{:Magic_Circle_Against_Alignment/chart}}
| References = * None }}
