{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 1, [[Cleric]] 1, [[Favored Soul]] 1, [[Harbinger]] 1, [[Paladin]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Melee weapon or Creature | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = You empower the touched weapon with a +1 enhancement bonus. Restricted weapon enchantment.
| Notes = * [[:Category:Weapon Enchantment|Restricted]]. {{:Template:WeaponEnchantmentNote}}
