{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Ooze Domain|Ooze]]) 4, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Acid | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = 11 meter cone | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You breathe forth a cone of acidic droplets. The cone inflicts 1d6 points of acid damage per caster level (maximum 15d6) to all hostiles and fixtures within its area of effect.
| Notes = * Targets only hostiles and fixtures. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Ooze Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Acid Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Ooze Domain|Ooze]]) 8, [[Elementalist]] 6, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Acid | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell creates an acid shield around your person. Any creature striking you with its body does normal damage, but at the same time the attacker takes 1d6 points +2 points per caster level of acid damage. Damage shield spells (aka biteback) that cause damage to a melee attacker do not stack. The last spell cast overrides any other damage shield. All damage shield spells are moved to the top of the [[Breach List]]. One exception: these spells '''do''' stack with the damage shield of the [[Aura Versus Alignment]] spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:Biteback Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Ooze Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|6]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Acid Damage]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Destruction Domain|Destruction]]) 9, [[Elementalist]] 9, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The spell causes everything within the area of effect to be pummeled by incoming meteors. All those caught in the destruction take 30d8 points of fire damage, except for allies. All those within 2 meters of the caster are also protected from the spell's effect.
| Notes = * Does not affect allies, meaning those in-party. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|9]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Destruction Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|9]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 5, [[Cleric]]([[Mind Domain|Mind]]) 5, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Warlock]] 6, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Enchantment | Descriptors = Mind-affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meter radius) | Duration = 2 rounds + 1 / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell creates a bank of blue fog that saps the will of all those who enter it. Victims take a 2d6 penalty (will save for half) on will saving throws against mind-affecting spells and effects and are dazed for 1 round (will save negates). This penalty persists for as long as the creature remains in the fog and for an additional 2d6 rounds upon leaving.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Enchantment School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|5]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Mind Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|6]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Druid]] 3, [[Shaman]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Moon Domain|Moon]]) 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Divine | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short | Area of Effect = Tiny (1 meter of target) | Duration = instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will save negates | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The cast sends a shimmering beam of silvery-white moonlight at a target. The damage and effects are based on the target's racial type. Other: 1d6 magic and 1d6 divine to the main target for every 2 caster levels, to a maximum of 6d6 each. (12d6 total) Deals half the amount on the secondary, area of effect targets (within 1m (3.33ft) of the main target) Undead: Takes +50% more Divine damage Shapechanger: Takes +50% more Magic damage. The main target must make a will save or be stunned for one round. Secondary targets are not subject to the stun.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|3]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[category:Moon Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Druid Spells|3]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Divine Damage]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Undead]] [[Category:Stun]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) or Single | Duration = Special | Counter Spells = [[Greater Spell Mantle]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = First, breaches a single enemy of up to 6 magical defenses or a group of enemies of 2 spell protections each according to the [[Breach List]]. Then, attempts to strip all magical effects from a single target in a dispel attempt. Or, if AoE targeted, attempting to remove the two most powerful spell effect from each creature. To remove an effect for the dispel portion, the caster makes a [[Dispel Tables|dispel]] check up to +23 dispel caster level. Finally, the spell will lower the SR of all creatures within the area of effect by 10 for 10 rounds. Does not lower [[Monk]] spell resistance.
| Notes = Any item that can cast this spell, like a scroll, Caster level is 15, instead of 17. {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=315213&sid=fc8dd5a06634d30177ec18ca4d8f5727#p315213 Monk SR] update note. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Abjuration School|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Forge Domain|Forge]]) 6, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 7, [[Wizard]] 7 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Point | Duration = 1 turn / levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster summons a powerful, sword-wielding helmed horror that acts as a faithful and loyal servant.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|7]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Forge Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|7]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Druid]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Pale Master]] 15, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 15 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Necromancy | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Point | Duration = 24 hours | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Summons and grants access to the strongest variants of undead per the [[Summoning_Changes#Undead_Summoning|undead summoning tier]]. The type of undead is dependent upon the summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details. Epic spells are not affected by arcane spell failure from armor, nor can they be interrupted, countered, or dispelled.
| Notes = *For [[Pale Master]], the level requirement is for gaining the feat during a level up and there is no relation at all with how the class gets the feat for free. {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
