{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Animal Domain|Animal]]) 9, [[Cleric]]([[Plant Domain|Plant]]) 8, [[Druid]] 8, [[Warlock]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will, special | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = All enemies within the area of effect have their spell resistance lowered by 1d4. All allies within the area of effect are healed for 3d8 hit points, +1 point per caster level. Also applies [[Lesser Spell Breach]] (2 spells are breached) effect to enemies caught in the AoE; the breach effect is saveless. With [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Transmutation|Greater Spell Focus: Transmutation]] 3 spells are breached and the AoE is increased. With [[Feat_changes#Spell_Focus:_Transmutation|Epic Spell Focus: Transmutation]] 3 spells are breached and the AoE is increased further.
| Notes = {{:Template:Dispel and Breach}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Animal Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Plant Domain Spells|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|8]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Undeath Domain|Undeath]]) 3, [[Favored Soul]] 3, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Harbinger]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 3, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meter radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Negative Energy Protection]] | Saves = Will 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = All creatures caught in the area of effect take 1d8 points of negative energy damage, +1 per caster level, to a maximum of +20. All creatures caught in the area also lose 1 point of strength per 4 caster levels. The strength malus lasts until it is removed by any restoration spell, or by resting. Negative energy spells have a reverse effect on undead, healing instead of harming them and giving a strength bonus.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Undeath Domain Spells|3]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|3]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|3]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|3]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|3]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Healing]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 5, [[Favored Soul]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Warlock]] 5, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster sends ribbons of Negative energy at a single target, striking them with 1d6 damage per caster level up to 20d6, fortitude save for half and an additional effect. If the target fails the fortitude save, they also lose 1 point of Strength per 4 Caster Levels. Strength bonuses from spells of similar types (such as Negative Energy Burst) will not stack when granted to an undead creature. If a target is killed by this spell, it rises as an uncontrolled zombie. This spell has a reverse effect on undead, healing them instead of harming them.
| Notes = {{Damage Spells}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=315363#p315363 Damage improved to 1d6/cl to a cap of 20d6] update. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|5]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|5]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Healing]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 2, [[Favored Soul]] 1, [[Hemomancer]] 1, [[Harbinger]] 1, [[Sorcerer]] 1, [[Spellsword]] 1, [[Wizard]] 1 | Innate Level = 1 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will 1/2 | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A ray of negative energy slams into the target creature, doing 1d6 points of damage. After level 1, the spell does an additional 1d6 points of damage for every 2 caster levels, to a maximum of 5d6 at level 9. Negative energy spells have a reverse effect on undead, healing instead of harming them.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
