{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 5, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Warlock]] 3, [[Wizard]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Illusion | Descriptors = Mind-Affecting, Evil | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Permanent | Counter Spells = [[Remove Curse]] | Saves = Will negates | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = You send a hideous and unsettling phantasmal vision to the creature you target. The nightmare prevents restful sleep and causes fatigue and 1d10 points of psychic damage per two caster levels (max 15d10) on already sleeping targets (sleeping targets will wake up from this). The nightmare is a Nightmare Curse and is permanent. Creatures who don't sleep (such as elves) are immune to this spell. Added Maximize Spell and Empower Spell metamagic feat.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Illusion School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|5]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|5]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|3]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]] [[Category:Permanent Effect]] [[Category:Curse]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Enchantment | Descriptors = Death, Mind-Affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 Round / 2 Levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude partial, Will partial | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The spell causes wracking pain and violent convulsions to the target creature and they must make a Fortitude save or die instantly. A surviving target receives a Will save to avoid further effects. Subjects failing the Will save are dazed for the duration of the spell and suffer 1d4 per caster level (Max 20d4) as psychic damage. Wrathful Castigation respects death immunity.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Enchantment School|8]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]] [[Category:Death Effect]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Cleric]]([[Illusion Domain|Illusion]]) 4, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Favored Soul]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Warlock]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Illusion | Descriptors = Fear, Mind-affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[True Seeing]] | Saves = Will and Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster conjures an image of utmost horror to strike down a single creature. The target may attempt a will save to disbelieve the spell, avoiding all ill effects. Failing that, the target then makes a fortitude save to avoid instant death. A successful save still inflicts 3d6 points of psychic damage. Fears a target for 1 round / level on a failed will save. A target that fails their fortitude save still dies.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Illusion School|4]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Illusion Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Fear Effect]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]] [[Category:Death Effect]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 6, [[Favored Soul]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = An outsider is summoned to assist the caster. The type of outsider is dependent upon the specific summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|6]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|6]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 5, [[Cleric]] 7, [[Cleric]]([[Evil Domain|Evil]], [[Good Domain|Good]]) 5, [[Favored Soul]] 6, [[Harbinger]] 4, [[Hemomancer]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 6, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 6 | Innate Level = 6 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Single or Point | Duration = 1 hour / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will (+2 DC) negates | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell has two modes of operation: targeting a single outsider, or summoning a planar ally. Targeted outsiders are paralyzed for 1 round per 2 caster levels. The type of summoned ally is based upon the specific summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Conjuration School|6]] [[Category:Bard Spells|5]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|7]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Evil Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Good Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|6]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|6]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|6]] [[Category:Innate Spells|6]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Summoning]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Shaman]] 21, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 15 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Conjuration | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Point | Duration = 24 hours | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Summons two powerful outsiders. The type of outsider is dependent upon the summon [[Summoning_Changes#Summoning_Streams|stream]]. Use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details. Conjuring a summon that is different from the caster's alignment is subject to [[Summoning_Changes#Alignment_divergence|alignment divergence]] and losing control of the summon. One can see the chance of hostility using the [[Console_command#-stream|-stream]] command, use [[Console_command#-stream|-stream ?]] for more details. Casters can only use streams on their own Good-Evil alignment axis: LG, NG summons [[Summons#Celestial_.28Archons.29|Celestial Archons]]; CG summons [[Summons#Celestial_.28Eladrin.29|Celestial Eladrin]]; LN, LE, TN summons [[Summons#Constructs|Mechanus]]; and NE, CN, CE summons [[Summons#Slaadi|Slaadi]]. One [[Summons#Outsiders|outsider]] tier 5 summon and one tier 6 summon will be summoned when this spell is cast. Epic spells are not affected by arcane spell failure from armor, nor can they be interrupted, countered, or dispelled.
| Notes = {{:Template:Summon Note}}
| References = * None }}
