| Description = The caster throws poisonous quills at a target, doing 1d8 points of damage (+1 per 2 levels of the caster — max +5), plus inflicting scorpion venom on the target if they fail a fortitude save.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
