{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Hemomancer]] 0, [[Druid]] 0, [[Favored Soul]] 0, [[Paladin]] 0, [[Ranger]] 0, [[Shaman]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = 1 Hour | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = This spell grants the target creature damage reduction 1/+1, absorbing 1d6 points of physical damage + 1 point per caster level before collapsing. The damage reduction improves to 2/+2 at caster level 7, 3/+3 at caster level 14, 4/+4 at caster level 21 and 5/+5 at caster level 28.
| Notes = {{:Template:Cantrips}}
