{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 3. [[Cleric]]([[Sun Domain|Sun]]) 2, [[Favored Soul]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
