{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 8, [[Cleric]]([[Sun Domain|Sun]]) 7, [[Druid]] 8, [[Elementalist]] 8, [[Favored Soul]] 8, [[Shaman]] 8 | Innate Level = 7 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Divine | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = 3 rounds | Counter Spells = [[Create Greater Undead]] | Saves = Reflex negates | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster summons a globe of divine radiance to blind and burn those within the area of effect. Undead take 1d6 points of divine damage per caster level, to a maximum of 10d6. All other monster types take 3d6 points of divine damage, and are blinded for 3 rounds. A successful reflex save halves the damage for undead and voids blindness for others. Inflict sunlight penalties to light sensitive races. The duration is 4 rounds, 2 with a successful reflex save (Vampire PC's will only be affected for a maximum of 3 rounds). This effect ignores spell resistance and will affect everyone in the area of effect, including the caster. Friendly creatures are always treated as if they'd passed the save. Darkness spells protect and restore the affected targets.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|7]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|8]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Sun Domain Spells|7]] [[Category:Druid Spells|8]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|8]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|7]] [[Category:Divine Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 6, [[Druid]] 6, [[Elementalist]] 5, [[Shaman]] 6, [[Sorcerer]] 5, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Warlock]] 7, [[Wizard]] 5, [[Cleric]]([[Sun Domain|Sun]]) 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Divine | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Gargantuan (8.33 meter radius) | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Reflex for half | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The spell causes everything within the area of effect to be bathed in harsh sunlight. All those caught in the destruction take 1d8 points of fire damage per 2 caster levels up to a maximum of 10d8 damage. Undead creatures take an extra 1d8 divine damage per 2 caster levels up to a maximum of 10d8 damage. Light-sensitive races may have their sensitivity triggered on a failed save.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Evocation School|5]] [[Category:Bard Spells|6]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Sun Domain Spells|5]] [[Category:Druid Spells|6]] [[Category:Elementalist Spells|5]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|6]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|5]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|7]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|5]] [[Category:Innate Spells|5]] [[Category:Divine Damage]] [[Category:Fire Damage]] [[Category:Reflex Save]] [[Category:Undead]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Cleric]] 0, [[Druid]] 0, [[Favored Soul]] 0, [[Shaman]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Healing | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Harmless | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster touches a friendly creature with less than 1 hit point remaining and grants them 1/- Bleed damage resistance for a duration of 1 turn. Creatures with with 0 hit points or less (who are bleeding out) are immediately sustained this way, and then restored back to 1 hit point after 1 round.
This spell will also prevent the effects of the [[Stop Heart]] spell if used upon an afflicted creature and grant immunity to it for 1 turn.
| Notes = {{Cantrips}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|0]] [[Category:Bard Spells|0]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|0]] [[Category:Druid Spells|0]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|0]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Healing]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Druid]] 8, [[Hemomancer]] 8, [[Shaman]] 8, [[Sorcerer]] 8, [[Spellsword]] 8, [[Warlock]] 8, [[Wizard]] 8 | Innate Level = 8 | Spell School = Transmutation | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short | Area of Effect = Cone | Duration = Varies | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Varies; negates statuses, and halves the damage | Spell Resistance = Yes | Description = Upon the completion of the incantation, the caster's breath undergoes a stunning metamorphosis. Wisps of shimmering energy encircle their mouth as the caster exhales. Iron golem: Slow (Immunity to Poison protects) {Fortitude Saving Throw}. Bebilith: Web entanglement (Immunity to Paralysis protects) {Reflex Saving Throw}. Silver Dragon: Daze (Immunity to Mind Affecting protects) {Will Saving Throw}. Prismatic Dragon: Confusion (Immunity to Mind Affecting protects) {Will Saving Throw}. Gorgon: Petrification (Immunity to Petrify, Immunity to Poison protect) {Fortitude Saving Throw}. Ironscale Hydra: 3d6 acid per 3 Caster Levels (damage is done with 3d6 intervals - energy resistance applies multiple times) {Reflex Saving Throw}. Pyro Hydra: 3d6 fire per 3 Caster Levels (damage is done with 3d6 intervals - energy resistance applies multiple times) {Reflex Saving Throw}. Cryo Hydra: 3d6 cold per 3 Caster Levels (damage is done with 3d6 intervals - energy resistance applies multiple times) {Reflex Saving Throw}.
| Notes = * None | References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Transmutation School|8]] [[Category:Druid Spells|8]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|8]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|8]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|8]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|8]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|8]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|8]] [[Category:Innate Spells|8]]

{{EpicSpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]] 21, [[Favored Soul]] 21, [[Hemomancer]] 21, [[Pale Master]] 15, [[Sorcerer]] 21, [[Wizard]] 21 | Spellcraft Prereq = 32 | Innate Level = 10 | Spell School = Necromancy | Components = Verbal | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Giant (15 meters radius) | Duration = 6 rounds | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster issues forth a powerful curse. The area around the caster becomes rich with profane sigils and vile energy. Before long a calamity curse is unleashed with a single burst of power. Those affected become the subject of the curse spoken and branded as the prey for the caster's ungovernable, maddening hunger: the mark of the vampiric feast, the mark of the prey. Creatures with blood will suffer 3d6 bleeding damage twice per round for a period of 6 rounds. Each time they take damage it heals the caster for 1d4+2 damage (no overheal). Creatures without blood take entropy damage instead and do not contribute to healing. A creature can be subject to only 1 such curse at a given time. (It does not stack). The effect ends early if the caster dies. The caster without ESF Necromancy or Gift of Necromancy (LM) will take 40d4 damage after the spell is concluded.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Epic Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy_School|e]] [[Category:Cleric Spells|e]] [[Category:Favored Soul Spells|e]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|e]] [[Category:Pale Master Spells|e]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|e]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|e]] [[Category:Innate Spells|e]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Undeath Domain|Undeath]]) 4, [[Cleric]]([[Vermin Domain|Vermin]]) 6, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Shaman]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 3, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Wizard]] 3 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Touch | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = [[Negative Energy Protection]] | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = If the caster succeeds in striking a target with a melee touch attack, the target creature takes 1d6 points of negative energy damage for every 2 caster levels (maximum 10d6). This damage is then applied to the caster's hit points as a temporary bonus. You can't gain more temporary hit points than what is required to kill the target (target's current hit points +10).
| Notes = * The temporary hit points last for one hour per two caster levels. Any pre-existing temporary hit points (from any source) are removed before the new ones are applied. {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|3]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Undeath Domain Spells|4]] [[Category:Vermin Domain Spells|6]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|2]] [[Category:Shaman Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|3]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|5]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|3]] [[Category:Innate Spells|3]] [[Category:Negative Energy]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 0, [[Harbinger]] 0, [[Sorcerer]] 0, [[Spellsword]] 0, [[Warlock]] 0, [[Wizard]] 0 | Innate Level = 0 | Spell School = Enchantment | Descriptors = Mind | Components = Verbal | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Single | Duration = Instant | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Will negates | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster laces their words with hateful energy and aggressively mocks a creature in range that is capable of hearing. The target takes 1d4 Psychic damage per 3 caster levels. They must roll a Will save or receive a -1 morale penalty per 9 caster levels to their Attack Bonus and a -2 morale penalty per 9 caster levels to Leadership, Bluff, and Intimidate for 1d2 rounds. This spell has no effect on targets that are immune to mind effects. The debuff is not applied if caster level is lower than the HD of the target.
Vicious Mockery will remove [[Serene Visage]] from any target it strikes.
| Notes = {{Cantrips}} {{Damage Spells}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Enchantment School|0]] [[Category:Bard Spells|0]] [[Category:Harbinger Spells|0]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|0]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|0]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|0]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|0]] [[Category:Innate Spells|0]] [[Category:Will Save]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Druid]] 5, [[Cleric]]([[Plant Domain|Plant]]) 5, [[Shaman]] 5 | Innate Level = 5 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = Nature | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Large (5 meter radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Yes (entangle) | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = When casting vine mine, the caster must select one of the following effects that will be created in the targeted area: entangle (as the spell), hamper movement (movement speed is halved), camouflage (add +4 competence bonus on hide checks).
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
