{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Fire Domain|Fire]]) 4, [[Druid]] 5, [[Elementalist]] 4, [[Shaman]] 5, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 5, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Evocation | Descriptors = Fire | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Wall 30 ft long | Duration = 1 round / 2 levels | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = This spell creates a curtain of fire that deals 2d6 + 1 per caster level points of fire damage to any creature that attempts to pass through it and double damage to undead. Does not damage corpses.
| Notes = {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
