{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 2, [[Cleric]]([[Vermin Domain|Vermin]]) 9, [[Druid]] 2, [[Harbinger]] 2, [[Hemomancer]] 3, [[Sorcerer]] 2, [[Spellsword]] 2, [[Wizard]] 2 | Innate Level = 2 | Spell School = Conjuration | Descriptors = None | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Medium (20 meters) | Area of Effect = Huge (6.67 meter radius) | Duration = 1 round / levels | Counter Spells = [[Freedom of Movement]] | Saves = Reflex partial | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = Sticky strands cling to all creatures within the area of effect, entangling them. Creatures who make their save can move, but at a reduced rate depending on their strength.
| Notes = * The movement reduction percentage is 65 minus twice the creature's strength, with a minimum reduction of 1%. This is calculated upon entering the area of effect and is not affected by changes to a creature's strength while the creature is in the area of effect. {{:Template:Persistent AoE}}
| References = * None }}
