{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Cleric]]([[Illusion Domain|Illusion]]) 9, [[Sorcerer]] 9, [[Wizard]] 9 | Innate Level = 9 | Spell School = Illusion | Descriptors = Fear, Mind-affecting | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Short (8 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meter radius) | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = [[True Seeing (spell)|True Seeing]] | Saves = Fortitude and Will | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = A horrible phantasm rises to stand before enemy creatures in the area of effect, causing them to make a will save. If they fail, the phantasm touches them and they must now make a fortitude saving throw. If this saving throw fails, the creature dies. Those who succeed the fortitude save still take 3d6 points of psychic damage. Creatures with less than 4 hit dice automatically die, without any saving throws. Weird fears targets for 1 round / level on a failed will save. Targets that fail their fortitude saves still die.
| Notes = {{:Template:Damage_Spells}}
| References = * None }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Illusion School|9]] [[Category:Cleric Domain Spells]] [[Category:Illusion Domain Spells|9]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|9]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|9]] [[Category:Innate Spells|9]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Will Save]] [[Category:Fear Effect]] [[Category:Mind-Affecting]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Hemomancer]] 4, [[Sorcerer]] 4, [[Spellsword]] 4, [[Warlock]] 4, [[Wizard]] 4 | Innate Level = 4 | Spell School = Necromancy | Descriptors = Death, Negative | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Long (40 meters) | Area of Effect = Colossal (10 meters radius) | Duration = Instantaneous | Counter Spells = None | Saves = Fortitude | Spell Resistance = Yes
| Description = The caster creates 1 beam per 3 Caster Level, to a maximum of 5 beams of necromantic energy and hurls them at targets within range and within the radius of the area of effect. They make a ranged touch attack for each ray and only one ray can strike a target at a time. On a hit, the target takes 10 + 1d4 Entropic damage per caster levels up to a maximum of 20d4. Targets struck by the rays are allowed a fortitude save to only take half damage. If this damage reduces a living target to 0 hit points, it dies instantly and withers into a husk. Inorganic targets such as constructs do not wither but are not immune to this spell's damage.
| Notes = {{Damage Spells}}
| References = * Added in the [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=314994#p314994 SPELLMAGEDDON: PART TWO] update. * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=315363#p315363 Damage 10 + 1d4 per cl capping at 20d4 & colossal] update. * [https://forum.nwnarelith.com/viewtopic.php?p=316539#p316539 1 beam per 3 Caster Level, to a maximum of 5 beams instead of an immutable maximum of 3] update. }}
[[Category:Spells]] [[Category:Necromancy School|4]] [[Category:Hemomancer Spells|4]] [[Category:Sorcerer Spells|4]] [[Category:Spellsword Spells|4]] [[Category:Warlock Spells|4]] [[Category:Wizard Spells|4]] [[Category:Innate Spells|4]] [[Category:Entropy Damage]] [[Category:Negative Energy]] [[Category:Fortitude Save]] [[Category:Death Effect]]

{{SpellBookPage | Spell Level = [[Bard]] 3, [[Cleric]]([[Air Domain|Air]]) 4, [[Cleric]]([[Destruction Domain|Destruction]], [[Luck Domain|Luck]]) 5, [[Hemomancer]] 5, [[Warlock]] 5 | Innate Level = 3 | Spell School = Abjuration | Descriptors = Sonic | Components = Verbal, Somatic | Range = Personal | Area of Effect = Caster | Duration = 1 round / level | Counter Spells = None | Saves = None | Spell Resistance = No
| Description = The caster is surrounded with whispers that injure any creature that hits the caster for 1d6+1/level points of sonic damage. Damage shield spells (aka biteback) that cause damage to a melee attacker do not stack. The last spell cast overrides any other damage shield. All damage shield spells are moved to the top of the [[Breach List]]. One exception: these spells '''do''' stack with the damage shield of the [[Aura Versus Alignment]] spell.
| Notes = {{:Template:Biteback Spells}}
| References = * None }}
